        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Many people go to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Machu Picchu",
            "zh": "马丘比丘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It is in the mountains of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Peru",
            "zh": "秘鲁"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The trip is hard. It is harder for "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "disabled",
            "ref": "v-disabled"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Wheel the World has changed this. The "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "company",
            "ref": "v-company"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "offers",
            "zh": "提供"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "special",
            "ref": "v-special"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " tours around the world. They are made for people in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "wheelchairs",
            "zh": "轮椅"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Two friends started Wheel the World. They are Camilo Navarro and Alvaro Silberstein. Silberstein uses a wheelchair. They wanted to go travelling together. That’s how Wheel the World began."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The tours use a special wheelchair. “It is a very light wheelchair,” Navarro says. “It’s very strong. It lets you get to every place, in all kinds of "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "terrain",
            "zh": "地形"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ".”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Wheel the World wants to help people with "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "disabilities",
            "ref": "v-disability"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It hopes they can "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "experience",
            "zh": "体验"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " things like others."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
